            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El dispositivo informó un error cuando Ferry lo abrió."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click **Check Again**, or unplug the device and plug it back in." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Haz clic en **Volver a comprobar**, o desconecta el dispositivo y vuelve a conectarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device went away during the task: the cable came out, it went to sleep, or it left the network." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
